// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_INVENTORY_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P671907895" "Take this box to the fifth quadrant.  Eyes alert."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_INVENTORY_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2699211111" "The contents of that crate are worth more than you are.  Don't drop it."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_INVENTORY_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2416463843" "That one is highly explosive so tread carefully.  Take it to quadrant nine."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_INVENTORY_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1732562000" "Where did you get that?  That's not on my list."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_INVENTORY_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P784563901" "I'm sorry your back hurts.  Now keep moving.  This material isn't going to move itself."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_INVENTORY_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P819435759" "Sure you can take a break.  I'll tell Lord Recluse you're tired.  He's an understanding man."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_INVENTORY_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2941196869" "How did you get in here?"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_INVENTORY_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P669249935" "Priority change:  waste the hero!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_INVENTORY_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2943374670" "Kill that one right there."

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1147855688" "You're not getting by me."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3569333132" "Oh, I don't think so."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2034410108" "I don't know how you got in here, but you ain't gettin' out."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3553169200" "The only way you're getting past me is over my unconscious body."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2002233019" "I'm Arachnos.  You're dead."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_DOORGUARDFEMALE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2189645642" "Oh, my dear, you are such the fool aren't you?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_DOORGUARDFEMALE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P388864596" "I simply cannot let you pass.  I'm afraid your demise is imminent."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_DOORGUARDFEMALE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3241229675" "It would simply not do to let you pass."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_DOORGUARDFEMALE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3726314166" "I'm afraid this lady and myself are going to have to prevent you from trespassing any further."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_DOORGUARDFEMALE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P654068210" "Ah, such a shame.  Boundaries are difficult for you?"

// FAULTLINE_DAM_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3025318445" "You!  Stop!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3288806850" "You're going down!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2472191996" "I don't care who you think you are, but you're trespassing here.  Prepare for some pain!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1207786045" "Shoot 'em, toss 'em in the water, electrocute 'em.  I don't care.  Just get rid of them."

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3223216098" "Secure here so far.  Let's move further down."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2665436223" "Mind your step.  Let's move on."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2711649560" "Let's continue through the usual route and then head in for replacements."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P87429317" "This way."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2278000766" "Through here."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P12394753" "A little further."

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1652373685" "How did you get in here??"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3872372021" "Secure the area!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P391708679" "Don't let them get through!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4088853968" "This area is restricted, especially to you, hero!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_DOORPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2853016918" "If they get to the bases, your life is forfeit!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_DOORPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1011978593" "Watch your step."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_DOORPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P923040498" "Big drops, guys.  I suggest you watch your step."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_DOORPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1011935066" "We'll do the whole of Overflow and then take a turn in Aftershock."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_DOORPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2652212156" "Up this way and then off to the left.  Mind where you walk.  Big drops."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_DOORPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2055004540" "You there!  Stop!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_DOORPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P208686946" "We got one!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_DOORPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2098303096" "Stop!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_DOORPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P288282540" "Hold it!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_DOORPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3307711835" "What the-?  Get 'em!"

// FAULTLINE_DAM_DOORPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2339052719" "Quiet.  We're on patrol.  This is no time for idle chit chat."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_DOORPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P126698899" "Stay in formation and follow me.  The door's just up this way."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_DOORPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2929141425" "Follow me."

// FAULTLINE_DAM_DOORPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3775317722" "I don't know how you got in, but you're not staying!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_DOORPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P469506209" "Breach!  Erase the hero!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_DOORPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1527404480" "Your good fortune has just ended, hero!"

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_FIREINTHEHOLE_GRENADETOSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3996520588" "Everybody back!  Let's do this!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_FIREINTHEHOLE_GRENADETOSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P417225297" "On my count...!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_FIREINTHEHOLE_GRENADETOSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1711316054" "Oh, this is going to be good.  My favorite part of the job."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_FIREINTHEHOLE_GRENADETOSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2647684244" "On three...!"

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_FIREINTHEHOLE_GRENADETOSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3069374199" "You're kidding me, right??"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_FIREINTHEHOLE_GRENADETOSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1038151075" "There are no words for the pain you're gonna endure for trespassing here!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_FIREINTHEHOLE_GRENADETOSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P7539890" "Ah, time for my favorite sport:  hero toss."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_FIREINTHEHOLE_GRENADETOSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1034329736" "I think I'll toss you in next, hero!"

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4097223734" "It was nice and quiet for so long.  Now we got heroes traipsing all over the place."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2640865932" "Well, looks like Circle moved out for good.  Hated those guys anyway, but a few others moved in.  No problem.  We can take 'em."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P665460398" "We're good here.  There's bits and pieces of activity, but unless they walk within five feet of us, I'm not lifting a finger."

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P147399904" "Change in plans!  Looks like we're going to smash some skulls after all.  The goody two-shoes are here."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3484601077" "Nice outfit, too bad you're gonna get blood on it.  All yours, of course."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1516922069" "So now you've committed two crimes, hero.  Trespassing on Arachnos space and that outfit."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1183198510" "Aftershock is going to look a whole lot nicer with you out of the picture, hero."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P210683619" "We got serious business here in Aftershock and you, hero, will not mess that up!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2558525999" "What...NOW you show up?  After HOW long?"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2459032934" "Yeah, we're good here.  I can see for miles."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4077387132" "Nope.  Nothing to report, really.  Nothing worth pulling a weapon out for, anyway."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3302084575" "Sure.  Twenty minutes, then we'll switch shifts."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P638422271" "Time to go to work!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3638893711" "Oh, here we go again."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2949099201" "They get all uppity when they think you're in their space, don't they?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P766625956" "If they get too close we'll toss them in the water.  No big deal."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2691752269" "Let's dance, hero!"

// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1776489662" "Between the Sky Raiders, Freedom Corps, and those heroes, this place is a zoo.  Remember the good old days when we could tunnel through here and search the bases for valuable items relatively undisturbed?"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P998680562" "We should just bring in our helicopter and blast two-thirds of this dam.  There goes Freedom Corps.  There goes Sky Raiders.  Done."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1429900286" "We really can't afford to fail here.  The temporal anchors aren't working as permanently as we'd hoped.  Recluse will make bait of us, if we don't solve this soon."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2977843036" "This place is way too 'clean' for my tastes.  No personality.  I know there's the whole 'half the city fell into the water' thing, but it's not gritty like the Rogue Isles.  Don't you agree?"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3671355421" "They have a strip mall here.  Did you see that?  A STRIP MALL.  I may very well throw up."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2299270297" "The last hero I took on?  Way too polite.  I almost threw up on his costume from the sweetness of it all."

// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1213858078" "Oh, here we go again!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2582902945" "Really, hero, must we?  MUST WE???"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2387538482" "Well, fine.  If I must teach you a lesson, I will.  You heroes really are not that bright, are you?  I've had to teach quite a few today.  This....is Arachnos area.  YOU...are not welcome.  Let the lesson begin."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P398910515" "Hang on a sec.  I just saw a hero.  Pain ensues."

// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P320272764" "Right."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1065466720" "I agree."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2196743234" "Hm..."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2552701509" "Mmm hmm.."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3257802919" "Well, you'd know.  You've been on this team longer."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_GUARD_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3910427845" "Really?  I never thought of it that way."

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P510914984" "Too clean.  It's just too clean.  I hate this place."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P800533172" "You know, I thought it would be cool to come to Paragon City, bust a few hero heads, steal some base wreckage supplies, etc., but it's not as fun as I thought it'd be.  I miss the Rogue Isles."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3424912720" "What say we go grab a hero later and toss him off a cliff?  Just make sure it's a super speeder."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1245285324" "Wreckage and natural disasters notwithstanding, this place is way too cheery for my tastes."

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3364690124" "We were having a private conversation here, pal.  I thought you heroes were supposed to be POLITE?"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3769471854" "Problems?"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3599940438" "What?  Come back for another beating?"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P514123924" "Nice costume.  I'm going to hurt you just for the ugliness of it."

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P387907102" "Ten more minutes?  I'll let the guys know."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1091714915" "Got it.  Thanks.  Okay, guys, ten more minutes and then break's over."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1058436328" "Yes, sir.  I'll send them up as soon as we're, uh, done here."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1845212172" "Which patrol?  Fine.  I'll send along a few guys."

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4251016030" "Break time's over!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2182015371" "Time to crack some heads!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4020201636" "Got a situation here.  Out."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P351086884" "Gotta go.  I just spotted a hero."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P215677673" "Did you see the guy fishing on the dock?  Wanna go torment him later?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2032454713" "Have you heard anything?  Has anyone found the technology in the wrecked super group bases yet?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3552669371" "What do you think?  How long will we be here?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P863703779" "Overflow's not so bad.  We could be stuck in New Overbrook."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3354494927" "Man, I hate heroes."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2133999073" "Here we go again!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4201124680" "Didn't we just do this?  I could have sworn not ten minutes ago I beat up a hero that looked JUST like you."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3123999378" "Hero spotted.  Let's go make their day miserable."



// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1503860600" "Let them have their space.  For now."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3484664868" "I'm not worried about the Corps or Sky Raiders.  We'll deal with them as we need to."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2428713502" "We'll send over some guys later.  Stir things up.  Can't let the dam get too quiet, now can we?"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1617969656" "I'm not worried.  We have already taken over both corners of the dam.  Those Corps and Raiders, a minor nuisance."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3994156460" "So what do you think of Faultline?  I think the major flood did wonders for this place."

// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1900288757" "Time to earn our pay!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2158942992" "I was TALKING here!  I thought heroes were supposed to be POLITE!"

// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4222297335" "In the tunnels?  How many?  Okay, I'll send a crew down."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3599357740" "Heroes?  Or Freakshow?  Okay, I'll send a crew to block the south end of the tunnel."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P201427968" "We're almost done here.  I'll send a few men up in about fifteen minutes to cover your crew."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3452090815" "What happened?  How did they get in?  Did they take anything important?  Okay, I'll send a few guys over."

// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P621755308" "Let's go, guys!  Move!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3946624954" "Hero alert!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1486537979" "Anyone that lets a hero into our base loses a rank!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1925685372" "Fight like your life depends on it.  Recluse doesn't like wimps."

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2812512883" "Relatively clear here."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P931540873" "Yeah, I see them.  I have my eye on them."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1390385979" "I'll let you know if anything important happens."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2612599558" "Nothing major.  If it gets serious, we'll send in some guys."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2680495947" "Yep.  I can see them now."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P890631413" "Ahhh, there they are.  Yep.  I'll keep an eye on them."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P965496969" "This part of Aftershock is clear."

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P797916976" "Too close.  Let's get to work!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3123296386" "Time to work!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2775241442" "Too close!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1985760859" "They're breaching the area, let's go!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2933853377" "Pretty good view from here."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2477748071" "Something that grabbed Bob last night.  What WAS that?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2136785264" "I think I would have preferred the Dam.  They get more action up there."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3225042200" "Yeah, we're on the lookout.  Nothing to report."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3332873492" "We're clear here.  Well, except for the usual."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4123153756" "Heads up, men!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3120432230" "Let's go!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1904671543" "Breach!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2988096056" "Action just came to us!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2872059665" "Overflow just got a bit more fun!"

// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3057539639" "Well, we have Sky Raiders and Freedom Corps hovering around like little girls.  Other than that we're clear."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2112480977" "Yes, sir.  I see them."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2328951584" "So far, not too close.  Don't worry, we'll take care of it if they move in."

// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P457064988" "They just moved in too close.  Let's go!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1754577091" "Gotta go.  We got targets."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4222081564" "Engaging heroes.  Out."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_MUAIRPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P270076292" "Hero spotted."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_MUAIRPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2779553521" "Now."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_MUAIRPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2565709625" "Engage."

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1384344927" "Mind the gaps.  Aftershock is one big drop."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P367693684" "Let's go.  This way."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3608207395" "Keep in line, men."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P490085953" "I have reports of activity up ahead.  Let's go."
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2017909831" "Stick close.  I don't want to have the scrape you up if you fall."

// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2000470153" "We got action here!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4152482611" "Let's take a few moments to crack some skulls!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P951336670" "Patrol can wait.  Making people bleed cannot!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3518457267" "Over here.  Let's go."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3625277343" "I'm not saying it again.  Stick close.  I'm not responsible if you up and fall off a cliff or into the water and drown."
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2523849739" "Twenty minutes then we're switching over to the Aftershock patrol.  Let's keep alert, guys."

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3019564000" "You know what to do!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1810999097" "Protect our interests!"

// FAULTLINE_DAM_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3137391837" "We keep our area free of enemies.  Let's go."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2193603129" "You guys know what to do.  We walk until someone gets in our way and then we take them down."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1455376999" "This dam isn't as big as it looks.  Eyes open for any enemies that get too close.  You guys know what to do."

// FAULTLINE_DAM_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3299344575" "Target spotted!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3885689868" "Time for some pain.  Let's go!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3610489565" "THAT is all you have, Corps?"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2446694053" "My sister hits harder than that!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1714373987" "You wanna join the fun?  Let's go!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2980817803" "Tragic!  You guys are tragic!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4258985129" "This battle ends when you guys are bleeding in the dirt!"

// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_LONGBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4293757377" "Save it!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_LONGBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P336784402" "You can't win!  You guys never do!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_LONGBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4056986579" "We'll just keep coming back until you're gone!"
// FAULTLINE_OVERFLOW_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_LONGBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1671268391" "Put the call out to all heroes!  Let's show them who this city belongs to!"



// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_TUNNEL_CRATEPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2726882815" "No!  You're not supposed to be here!  You're goin' down!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_TUNNEL_CRATEPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2239636466" "You just made the biggest mistake of your life!"
// FAULTLINE_AFTERSHOCK_TUNNEL_CRATEPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3263476403" "This ends here and now!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_DIGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4087461598" "Does anyone want to switch with me?  My back is killing me."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_DIGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P596310911" "Why are we digging here?  The base wreckage is 20 feet down."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_DIGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P583463587" "I think I might have something here."

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_DIGGER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2823965769" "Wrong place wrong time, hero!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_DIGGER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1253256070" "You got no chance, hero!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_DIGGER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4050719204" "You're not getting in on this action, hero!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P991763401" "Keep it up.  Just a few more feet."
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3796182536" "Put your back into it.  Come on!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2609532059" "You've been digging for two minutes.  Come on, man up!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1018546741" "Let's go!  We're on a deadline!"

// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2055979190" "Forget the digging!  Use your shovels on the hero!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2134320154" "Goody two-shoes squad has arrived!"
// FAULTLINE_ALLHOODS_DIGGING_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4148694833" "This is going to hurt you a lot more than it hurt you last time I took you out."

// FAULTLINE_DAM_CRATEMOVE_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2431074312" "Over there.  Be careful with that."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_CRATEMOVE_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2733664797" "You know where to put it.  Go to it."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_CRATEMOVE_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1775829825" "Not there.  Over there."

// FAULTLINE_DAM_CRATEMOVE_MOVE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4283061965" "No one touches this stuff!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_CRATEMOVE_MOVE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3499964912" "How'd you get in here?!"

// FAULTLINE_DAM_EXAMINETECH_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3581559089" "Wow, I had no idea this did that."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_EXAMINETECH_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2401609402" "This database is so handy.  I had no idea what this thing was."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_EXAMINETECH_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P131367753" "I'm sure somewhere in all this equipment we can find the technology Lord Recluse requires."

// FAULTLINE_DAM_EXAMINETECH_LAPTOP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P285890401" "This is ours!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_EXAMINETECH_LAPTOP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1250938103" "We've got a breach!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_EXAMINETECH_LAPTOP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1975442401" "Don't let them get the equipment!"

// FAULTLINE_DAM_EXAMINETECH_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3121403871" "What does the database say? I need to log it."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_EXAMINETECH_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2996411818" "It's a what?  You'll need to spell that for me."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_EXAMINETECH_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3610452074" "Hang on, you're talking too fast.  I need to write this down."

// FAULTLINE_DAM_EXAMINETECH_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2562216655" "Come on!  Let's take them out!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_EXAMINETECH_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2204582749" "We can't let them get this stuff.  Recluse will destroy us!"

// FAULTLINE_DAM_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSSKYRAIDERS_SKYRAIDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2854674119" "That all you got, Arachnos?"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSSKYRAIDERS_SKYRAIDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P233279678" "No contest!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSSKYRAIDERS_SKYRAIDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1284800580" "Bring it on, all of you!"
// FAULTLINE_DAM_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSSKYRAIDERS_SKYRAIDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2365790672" "This can only end badly for you!"

// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_CHATTER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P966857662" "These tunnels are perfect.  We can travel back and forth to the Dam without being bothered."
// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_CHATTER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P800605211" "We're finding some good stuff in here.  Tunneling in?   Genius."
// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_CHATTER_CHATTERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3301606497" "I guess we'll just have to keep digging until we get what Lord Recluse needs.  Who knows how long that will be?"

// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_CHATTER_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P411964607" "You!  How did you get in here??"
// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_CHATTER_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2510177923" "Intruder!"
// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_CHATTER_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1167457401" "How on EARTH did a hero get in here?!"
// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_CHATTER_CHATTERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1940940450" "You've GOT to be kidding me!  Crush the hero!"

// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_CHATTER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2171290221" "I know."
// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_CHATTER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1984987240" "Agreed."
// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_CHATTER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3319922245" "Well said."
// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_CHATTER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P456000061" "I couldn't agree more."
// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_CHATTER_CHATTERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3076307170" "You said it."

// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_WALKIETALKIE_UPDATER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4110020934" "We're good down here.  Heroes keep trying to infiltrate, but we're taking care of them as we spot them."
// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_WALKIETALKIE_UPDATER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2667821178" "All systems are functional down here and the excavations are going as planned."
// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_WALKIETALKIE_UPDATER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3206145084" "We're good down here.  How are things topside?"
// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_WALKIETALKIE_UPDATER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3204262068" "How's my signal?  Can you hear me okay?"

// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_WALKIETALKIE_UPDATER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2849272117" "Gotta go!  Another hero!"
// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_WALKIETALKIE_UPDATER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P876583694" "We've got an intruder!  I'm out!"
// FAULTLINE_TUNNELS_WALKIETALKIE_UPDATER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3735385446" "I have to go!  I have a hero to crush!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2441956085" "Like I'm going to let you pass."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1395594910" "Not today."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1002176119" "Are you serious?"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1755571307" "You made a wrong turn!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P303986195" "Well of course we're being jumped on all sides, but for now, it's nothing we can't handle."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1498365484" "I realize my career is on the line should anything go 'awry'.  I won't let you down."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4024065461" "No.  I said check the south patrol point.  Over."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3957049800" "Noooo.  The south checkpoint.  No.  Your other left."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2259855656" "Secure it.  By any means necessary.  We're done here."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2400186965" "Not on my watch!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P868971541" "This is going to end very badly for you."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1291070063" "Play time's over!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CRAB_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2310621277" "Everything is an opportunity.  This is the same as any other.  Invasion notwithstanding."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CRAB_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2612693379" "I see all the villains running around and all I want to say is, 'et tu, Brute'?"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CRAB_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P595876004" "I just wish we were closer to the ship.  Sure I understand that we need to keep a low profile."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CRAB_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P369042043" "Sure those villains can run around and 'help', but that doesn't mean that we're not going to attack them for it.  I don't care what kind of deal Vanguard struck with them."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CRAB_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4128983401" "Well, sure it's kind of mean to attack the villains when they're just trying to help those puny heroes fight against the Rikti.  But seriously?  It's good for them.  Builds character.  Plus, it's fun."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CRAB_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1591450876" "What?  I need a reason to attack villains?  If they're associating with heroes, they're fair game.  I don't care what kind of 'agreement' Recluse may or may not have made with the Vanguard."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CRAB_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3215648814" "Time for the fight of your life!  Too bad it'll be a short one!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CRAB_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P885741875" "I'm going to turn you into lunch meat!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CRAB_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2844254065" "I LOVE this War Zone!  Let's go!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2859811551" "Of course, it will be done."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1573008653" "Absolutely.  Take care of it.  I will handle things from this end."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3472505853" "I will take care of it.  Yes.  Understood."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3955980819" "That is unfortunate.  You understand that I will need to take the appropriate action."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1589177598" "Excellent news.  I will send over some reinforcements to help you with your find."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1720993088" "Oh dear, your day will end badly, I'm afraid."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4057777321" "Have you no sense of decorum? That was an interruption."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1930086562" "I do not take kindly to interference."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P594043824" "Yes.  We have targets in our sights now."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2006991736" "I understand, sir.  Perfectly.  I will not fail you."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2779221749" "We should see some targets coming in from the west soon.  Do be ready."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2999363" "It is all clear here.  I will be sure to notify you should anything arise.  Thank you, sir.  It is my pleasure."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P797839014" "Refocus your attentions to these ones!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1922702977" "Feel free to use unacceptably excessive force!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2118039282" "Oh, my dear!  Today is not your day!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4046177515" "I saw something up here on the last pass.  Let's check it out."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3847601637" "Yeah, I heard it, too.  Let's check it out."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P788017436" "Three more passes and then we'll try the other perimeter."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1412026879" "Fire!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1308552400" "Over here!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2713711665" "I got something!"

// RWZ_SPIDERPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1167632575" "Taste my venom."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_UPDATER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P603993420" "We've had several skirmishes today.  More heroes and the...others have been moving in on our perimeter."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_UPDATER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3495115709" "We are under control here, sir.  Yes.  I will let you know if anything changes."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_UPDATER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1033093702" "The reconnaissance crew has been on top of any surprise attacks.  I'll inform you if anything changes."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_UPDATER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4046990267" "They're attacking the patrols.  We'll need some reinforcements soon."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_UPDATER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2464961203" "Sir, I must go.  We're being attacked.  Again."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_UPDATER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2387030327" "I have no time.  I've just spotted something I'd like to catch."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_FORTUNATA_UPDATER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1643801741" "I will update you later.  I have work to do!"

// FB_CHECKPOINT_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1523064118" "No one gets past without my authorization.  No one."
// FB_CHECKPOINT_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1362022694" "I don't care.  No one  gets past.  We have our orders."
// FB_CHECKPOINT_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3202135849" "We have our orders.  No one gets past."
// FB_CHECKPOINT_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P445968393" "If anyone gets through here, it's on your head.  Got me?"

// FB_CHECKPOINT_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1692765478" "Don't let them through!"
// FB_CHECKPOINT_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1449245306" "Your head on the line if they get through!"

// FB_GUARD_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P134361148" "So far so good.  Clear for now."
// FB_GUARD_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2694740123" "A few scrimmages earlier.  Seems pretty calm right now, though."
// FB_GUARD_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2507435060" "I hate this Striga place.  Too much water."
// FB_GUARD_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4029013615" "Yeah, we're clear here, but not for long.  Those meddling heroes always get into everything."

// FB_GUARD_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P514710782" "See?  Meddling heroes!"
// FB_GUARD_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P772895193" "Here comes a cliche!"
// FB_GUARD_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P542554391" "Excessive force is permitted and encouraged!"

// FB_CRATEMOVE_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P283785921" "I don't care if you just moved it.  Move it again."
// FB_CRATEMOVE_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1278285628" "EASY with that!  That's worth more than you are."
// FB_CRATEMOVE_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1844480454" "Break time in 20 minutes, not a minute sooner."
// FB_CRATEMOVE_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3036924083" "If you keep whining, you'll be replaced.  Permanently."

// FB_CRATEMOVE_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3741191597" "Don't let them get anywhere near this stuff!"
// FB_CRATEMOVE_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3695478060" "Play time!"
// FB_CRATEMOVE_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3116979941" "Crush some heroes and call it a day!"
// FB_CRATEMOVE_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3404435140" "You!"
// FB_CRATEMOVE_STRIGA_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P295094819" "Man, I hate you guys!"

// VILLAINLOUNGE_ARACHNOS_DUOCHAT_SPEAKER :
"P422294823" "These guys have no idea, do they?"

// VILLAINLOUNGE_ARACHNOS_DUOCHAT_SPEAKER2 :
"P4120193599" "Are these guys that stupid to believe..."

// VILLAINLOUNGE_ARACHNOS_DUOCHAT_DEALING_DEAL :
"P2389037971" "I call dibs on that one guy's boots..."

// VILLAINLOUNGE_ARACHNOS_DUOCHAT_DEALING_RECEIVE :
"P3501490781" "Go ahead, I've already got three pairs from last week..."

// VILLAINLOUNGE_ARACHNOS_CELLPHONE_CHAT :
"P1586755864" "No, sir.  Looks like one is here now, though.  This should go much faster..."

// VILLAINLOUNGE_ARACHNOS_DUOCOFFEE_COFFEEDRINKER_CHAT :
"P3471988426" "Wait... you made sure you gave me the 'other' cup, right?..."

// VILLAINLOUNGE_ARACHNOS_DUOCOFFEE_DONUTEATER_CHAT :
"P3320864362" "If they only knew what really happens..."

// VILLAINLOUNGE_ARACHNOS_NEWSPAPER_READER_CHAT :
"P3242983394" "Hmmm... okay, check!  All messages are fully 'fnord'ed"

// VILLAINLOUNGE_WANNABE_DUOCHAT_SPEAKER :
"P1807335175" "Man, I'm hoping I get in."
// VILLAINLOUNGE_WANNABE_DUOCHAT_SPEAKER :
"P2698190683" "Do we really have to do this kinda stuff all the time?"
// VILLAINLOUNGE_WANNABE_DUOCHAT_SPEAKER :
"P3656021206" "I hope they give me a big suit like that Scorpion dude."

// VILLAINLOUNGE_WANNABE_DUOCHAT_SPEAKER2 :
"P582778691" "There's gotta be a better way to make a quick buck!"
// VILLAINLOUNGE_WANNABE_DUOCHAT_SPEAKER2 :
"P3760797824" "Oh man... it's YOU.  Now it's gonna get worse."
// VILLAINLOUNGE_WANNABE_DUOCHAT_SPEAKER2 :
"P2561185654" "Has anyone actually talked with someone who passed these trials?"

